{"seq":3,"slug":"remedy-rule-change-monitor","title":"救济税公告变更监控与重算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/remedy-compliance-procurement/remedy-rule-change-monitor","wordCount":1781,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"救济税公告变更监控与重算\">救济税公告变更监控与重算</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>贸易救济税率不是静态主数据。它在整个生命周期里被<strong>至少七类程序</strong>反复改写：立案与初裁、临时措施实施与延长、终裁、行政复审（每年或定期）、新出口商复审、范围裁定、反规避调查、以及日落复审。任何一次改动都可能改变某一批货物的应纳税率，而改动以<strong>公告</strong>（gazette notice / Federal Register notice）的形式发布在各自法域的官方渠道上。因此监控的本质是：<strong>把公告流变成税率版本流，再把税率版本流变成重算任务</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[官方公告源] --&gt; A1[联邦公报 Federal Register]&#10;    A --&gt; A2[官方公报/商务部公告]&#10;    A --&gt; A3[税则与配额更新]&#10;    A1 --&gt; B[公告抓取与解析]&#10;    A2 --&gt; B&#10;    A3 --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; C{公告类型识别}&#10;    C --&gt;|立案/初裁| D[新增 PROVISIONAL 版本]&#10;    C --&gt;|终裁| E[写入 DEFINITIVE 版本]&#10;    C --&gt;|行政复审| F[刷新厂商税率版本]&#10;    C --&gt;|范围/反规避| G[更新 scope + 追补征]&#10;    C --&gt;|日落| H[更新措施状态机]&#10;    D --&gt; I[重算任务队列]&#10;    E --&gt; I&#10;    F --&gt; I&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt; J[差异报告 + 影响面评估]\">graph TD\n    A[官方公告源] --&gt; A1[联邦公报 Federal Register]\n    A --&gt; A2[官方公报/商务部公告]\n    A --&gt; A3[税则与配额更新]\n    A1 --&gt; B[公告抓取与解析]\n    A2 --&gt; B\n    A3 --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; C{公告类型识别}\n    C --&gt;|立案/初裁| D[新增 PROVISIONAL 版本]\n    C --&gt;|终裁| E[写入 DEFINITIVE 版本]\n    C --&gt;|行政复审| F[刷新厂商税率版本]\n    C --&gt;|范围/反规避| G[更新 scope + 追补征]\n    C --&gt;|日落| H[更新措施状态机]\n    D --&gt; I[重算任务队列]\n    E --&gt; I\n    F --&gt; I\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt; J[差异报告 + 影响面评估]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公告类型</th>\n<th>影响对象</th>\n<th>生效特征</th>\n<th>是否可追溯</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>立案/初裁</td>\n<td>临时措施保证金</td>\n<td>自公告日或指定日起</td>\n<td>关键情形下可溯 90 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终裁</td>\n<td>确定性税率</td>\n<td>自公告日或指定日起</td>\n<td>通常不可溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行政复审终裁</td>\n<td>某一厂商的税率</td>\n<td>按复审期覆盖区间</td>\n<td>可覆盖复审期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新出口商复审</td>\n<td>新厂商的单独税率</td>\n<td>自复审发起或裁定日</td>\n<td>可溯至发起日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围裁定</td>\n<td>产品范围</td>\n<td>自裁定日起</td>\n<td>视裁定措辞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反规避</td>\n<td>范围 + 保证金</td>\n<td><strong>自发起日起</strong></td>\n<td>见反规避章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日落复审</td>\n<td>措施存续状态</td>\n<td>复审结论日</td>\n<td>复审期间继续有效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"公告源的工程化采集\">公告源的工程化采集</h2><h3 id=\"公告记录的字段设计\">公告记录的字段设计</h3><p>监控的第一步是把分散的公告源变成结构化的公告记录。这一步不能靠人工巡读——条文密集、频率不定、且一次漏读可能造成整批货选错税率。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;notice_id&quot;: &quot;FR-2026-19342&quot;,&#10;  &quot;source&quot;: &quot;FEDERAL_REGISTER&quot;,&#10;  &quot;agency&quot;: &quot;ITA&quot;,&#10;  &quot;document_type&quot;: &quot;NOTICE&quot;,&#10;  &quot;published_on&quot;: &quot;2026-09-14&quot;,&#10;  &quot;effective_on&quot;: &quot;2026-09-14&quot;,&#10;  &quot;case_number&quot;: &quot;A-570-xxx&quot;,&#10;  &quot;instrument_type&quot;: &quot;ADD&quot;,&#10;  &quot;origin_country&quot;: &quot;XX&quot;,&#10;  &quot;action&quot;: &quot;FINAL_DETERMINATION&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rates_published&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;producer_id&quot;: &quot;P-8891&quot;, &quot;rate_value&quot;: 86.54, &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;INDIVIDUAL&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;producer_id&quot;: &quot;P-9002&quot;, &quot;rate_value&quot;: 7.31, &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;INDIVIDUAL&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;producer_id&quot;: &quot;ALL_OTHERS&quot;, &quot;rate_value&quot;: 131.27, &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;ALL_OTHERS&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;retroactive_from&quot;: null,&#10;  &quot;source_url&quot;: &quot;https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/09/14/...&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"notice_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FR-2026-19342\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FEDERAL_REGISTER\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"agency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ITA\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"document_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NOTICE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"published_on\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-14\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effective_on\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-14\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"case_number\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A-570-xxx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"instrument_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ADD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"origin_country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"XX\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"FINAL_DETERMINATION\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rates_published\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"producer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P-8891\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">86.54</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INDIVIDUAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"producer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"P-9002\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7.31</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"INDIVIDUAL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"producer_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ALL_OTHERS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">131.27</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ALL_OTHERS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"retroactive_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/09/14/...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>字段设计的关键点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><code>published_on</code> 与 <code>effective_on</code> 必须分开</strong>——公告日决定了何时&quot;我们知道了&quot;，生效日决定了何时&quot;开始适用&quot;。两者混同会导致对公告前已发运货物的错判。</li>\n<li><strong><code>rates_published</code> 是数组而非标量</strong>——一次终裁同时公布多家厂商的税率与兜底税率。</li>\n<li><strong><code>retroactive_from</code> 单独存</strong>——它不为空时触发追溯重算。</li>\n<li><strong><code>source_url</code> 必存</strong>——审计时需逐条回指公告原文。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"采集的两种模式\">采集的两种模式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主动拉取</td>\n<td>定时调用官方检索接口/抓取公报</td>\n<td>小时级到日级</td>\n<td>常规监控</td>\n<td>漏掉未按预期命中的条目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订阅推送</td>\n<td>官方提供的邮件/feed 订阅</td>\n<td>分钟级到小时级</td>\n<td>紧急事项</td>\n<td>依赖订阅通道可靠性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代理通知</td>\n<td>报关行/律所主动告知</td>\n<td>日级</td>\n<td>补充覆盖</td>\n<td>依赖第三方，不可审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工巡检</td>\n<td>定期人工核查</td>\n<td>周级</td>\n<td>兜底</td>\n<td>不可靠，仅作补充</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产系统应至少 <strong>主动拉取 + 人工巡检兜底</strong> 两条并行，并用&quot;未覆盖的 case_number&quot;清单反向校验覆盖率——即把系统已知的全部在册案件与当期公告按月比对，找出&quot;有措施但本期无任何公告&quot;的案件，这类案件往往意味着采集漏了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从公告到税率版本的重算管线\">从公告到税率版本的重算管线</h2><h3 id=\"六步重算管线\">六步重算管线</h3><p>采集到公告后，核心动作是&quot;<strong>把公告中的税率写入版本表，并识别受影响的历史报关</strong>&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"on_notice(notice):&#10;  1. IDENTIFY  match notice.case_number -&gt; order_id&#10;               若匹配不到，进人工队列（可能是新案件，需先创建 order）&#10;  2. VERSION   对 rates_published 每条:&#10;                  upsert remedy_rate_version(&#10;                    order_id, producer_id, rate_value, basis,&#10;                    published_at = notice.published_on,&#10;                    effective_from = notice.effective_on,&#10;                    retroactive_from = notice.retroactive_from,&#10;                    proceeding = map(notice.action))&#10;  3. RECOMPUTE 计算受影响报关集合:&#10;                  affected = entries where&#10;                    hs in order.scope&#10;                    and origin_country == notice.origin_country&#10;                    and producer_id in rates_published.producer_id&#10;                    and entry_date &gt;= coalesce(retroactive_from, effective_on)&#10;  4. DIFF      对每条 affected 报关, 比较 old_rate 与 new_rate&#10;  5. EMIT      差异不为零 -&gt; 生成重算任务 + 财务影响汇总&#10;  6. STATE     若 action 涉及日落/撤销 -&gt; 推进措施状态机 (见 1_remedy.../3_)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>on_notice(notice):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. IDENTIFY  match notice.case_number -> order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>               若匹配不到，进人工队列（可能是新案件，需先创建 order）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. VERSION   对 rates_published 每条:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  upsert remedy_rate_version(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    order_id, producer_id, rate_value, basis,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    published_at = notice.published_on,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    effective_from = notice.effective_on,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    retroactive_from = notice.retroactive_from,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    proceeding = map(notice.action))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. RECOMPUTE 计算受影响报关集合:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  affected = entries where</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    hs in order.scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    and origin_country == notice.origin_country</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    and producer_id in rates_published.producer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    and entry_date >= coalesce(retroactive_from, effective_on)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. DIFF      对每条 affected 报关, 比较 old_rate 与 new_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  5. EMIT      差异不为零 -> 生成重算任务 + 财务影响汇总</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  6. STATE     若 action 涉及日落/撤销 -> 推进措施状态机 (见 1_remedy.../3_)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第 3 步的 <code>affected</code> 集合是这套管线里最容易算错的地方。必须注意：<strong>新税率通常只对生效日之后的报关适用</strong>，只有 <code>retroactive_from</code> 非空时才向前覆盖。把新税率无条件向前应用到全部历史报关，会产生大量虚假的退税/补缴任务。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 受影响报关的重算候选（区分&quot;新适用&quot;与&quot;追溯适用&quot;）&#10;WITH new_rate AS (&#10;  SELECT version_id, producer_id, rate_value, effective_from, retroactive_from&#10;  FROM remedy_rate_version&#10;  WHERE order_id = $1 AND version_id = $2&#10;)&#10;SELECT e.entry_id,&#10;       e.entry_date,&#10;       e.remedy_origin,&#10;       prev.rate_value AS old_rate,&#10;       nr.rate_value   AS new_rate,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN nr.retroactive_from IS NOT NULL&#10;              AND e.entry_date &gt;= nr.retroactive_from THEN &#39;RETROACTIVE&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;PROSPECTIVE&#39;&#10;       END AS recompute_kind&#10;FROM customs_entry e&#10;JOIN new_rate nr ON nr.producer_id = e.producer_id&#10;LEFT JOIN remedy_rate_version prev&#10;       ON prev.order_id = e.remedy_order_id&#10;      AND prev.producer_id = e.producer_id&#10;      AND prev.effective_from &lt; nr.effective_from&#10;WHERE e.remedy_order_id = $1&#10;  AND e.entry_date &gt;= COALESCE(nr.retroactive_from, nr.effective_from)&#10;  AND (prev.rate_value IS NULL OR prev.rate_value &lt;&gt; nr.rate_value);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 受影响报关的重算候选（区分\"新适用\"与\"追溯适用\"）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id, producer_id, rate_value, effective_from, retroactive_from</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remedy_rate_version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> version_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">remedy_origin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       prev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> old_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       nr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">retroactive_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">retroactive_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RETROACTIVE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PROSPECTIVE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recompute_kind</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customs_entry e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_rate nr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">producer_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">producer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> remedy_rate_version prev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">remedy_order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">producer_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">producer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">remedy_order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entry_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">retroactive_from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">prev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prev</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"差异报告与影响面评估\">差异报告与影响面评估</h2><h3 id=\"差异类型与财务动作\">差异类型与财务动作</h3><p>重算任务产出的不是&quot;改数字&quot;，而是<strong>差异报告</strong>：多少票、多少钱、方向如何、以及是否需要实际退税或补缴。这份报告是财务与采购的共同输入。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>触发情形</th>\n<th>财务动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>税率上调（前瞻）</td>\n<td>成本增加</td>\n<td>终裁高于临时、复审上调</td>\n<td>更新报价与预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税率上调（追溯）</td>\n<td>补缴</td>\n<td>关键情形、复审覆盖历史期</td>\n<td>生成补缴预备金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税率下调（前瞻）</td>\n<td>成本下降</td>\n<td>复审下调、厂商获新税率</td>\n<td>更新报价与预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税率下调（追溯）</td>\n<td>退税</td>\n<td>复审下调覆盖历史期</td>\n<td>申请退税，跟踪清算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>措施终止</td>\n<td>停征</td>\n<td>日落复审否定、撤销</td>\n<td>停止计提，申请退还保证金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围扩大</td>\n<td>新增征税</td>\n<td>scope ruling / 反规避肯定</td>\n<td>重算历史敞口 + 供应商评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>范围排除</td>\n<td>免征</td>\n<td>排除裁定</td>\n<td>申请退税</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中&quot;<strong>范围扩大</strong>&quot;一类的金额通常最大，因为它同时改变&quot;哪些产品被覆盖&quot;和&quot;从何时起被覆盖&quot;两个维度。19 CFR 351.226 规定的反规避程序在<strong>发起日</strong>即适用被覆盖税率并要求保证金，因此一处肯定性裁定可能意味着过去数月的进口都需补缴。见 <a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/19/351.226\">19 CFR § 351.226</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监控任务的调度与去重\">监控任务的调度与去重</h2><h3 id=\"调度频率与幂等约束\">调度频率与幂等约束</h3><p>监控是持续动作，需要防止两类退化：<strong>漏报</strong>（公告未被采集）与<strong>重报</strong>（同一公告被反复处理）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"scheduling:&#10;  pull_authority_feeds:  每 4 小时一次&#10;  reconcile_case_register: 每 24 小时一次   # 在册案件 vs 本期公告覆盖率&#10;  detect_stale_rates:    每 24 小时一次   # effective_to 临近但无续期公告&#10;  refresh_quota_status:  每 6 小时一次   # TRQ 余额与关键标记&#10;&#10;dedup:&#10;  key = hash(notice_id) 或 hash(source + published_on + case_number + action)&#10;  -- 同一公告在不同渠道被采两次时，只处理一次&#10;  -- 公告被修订(correction)时，视为新条目并链接到原条目&#10;&#10;idempotency:&#10;  重算任务带 (entry_id, version_id) 唯一约束&#10;  -- 防止同一版本重复生成重算，导致重复退补\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>scheduling:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pull_authority_feeds:  每 4 小时一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  reconcile_case_register: 每 24 小时一次   # 在册案件 vs 本期公告覆盖率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  detect_stale_rates:    每 24 小时一次   # effective_to 临近但无续期公告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  refresh_quota_status:  每 6 小时一次   # TRQ 余额与关键标记</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dedup:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  key = hash(notice_id) 或 hash(source + published_on + case_number + action)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -- 同一公告在不同渠道被采两次时，只处理一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -- 公告被修订(correction)时，视为新条目并链接到原条目</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>idempotency:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  重算任务带 (entry_id, version_id) 唯一约束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  -- 防止同一版本重复生成重算，导致重复退补</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>detect_stale_rates</code> 这条任务直接对应本 hub 第 1 章讲过的陷阱：措施的五年到期日临近但<strong>没有</strong>发出日落复审启动公告时，系统不应假定措施终止，而应告警——因为复审请求的提交窗口是&quot;期满前三个月&quot;，无公告可能只意味着请求尚未提交。相关机制见 <a href=\"../remedy-duty-mechanism/provisional-duty-deposit-sunset\">临时税、保证金与日落复审</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监控与采购决策的闭环\">监控与采购决策的闭环</h2><h3 id=\"阈值化路由到三条下游\">阈值化路由到三条下游</h3><p>监控的最终价值在于驱动采购与定价动作，而不是生成报表。闭环设计是把差异报告直接路由到三个下游：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"差异报告 -&gt; 采购:  若某供应商税率上调 &gt; 阈值, 触发换源评估 (见 2_supplier-sourcing-substitution)&#10;        -&gt; 定价:  若整体税负变动 &gt; 阈值, 触发售价复核&#10;        -&gt; 合规:  若出现范围扩大或反规避, 触发举证材料准备 (见 1_non-preferential-origin-evidence)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>差异报告 -> 采购:  若某供应商税率上调 > 阈值, 触发换源评估 (见 2_supplier-sourcing-substitution)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        -> 定价:  若整体税负变动 > 阈值, 触发售价复核</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        -> 合规:  若出现范围扩大或反规避, 触发举证材料准备 (见 1_non-preferential-origin-evidence)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>阈值化是必要的：每一份公告都触发全量人工复核会让流程失效。合理的做法是——金额影响低于阈值的自动入账并归档，高于阈值的进入人工决策队列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>救济税率至少被七类程序改写：立案/初裁、临时措施、终裁、行政复审、新出口商复审、范围/反规避、日落复审；监控的本质是&quot;公告流 → 税率版本流 → 重算任务&quot;。</li>\n<li>公告记录必须把 <code>published_on</code> 与 <code>effective_on</code> 分开，<code>rates_published</code> 用数组承载多厂商税率，<code>source_url</code> 必存以供审计回指。</li>\n<li>重算管线的关键在 <code>affected</code> 集合的界定：新税率通常只前瞻适用，仅 <code>retroactive_from</code> 非空时向前覆盖；无条件前推会产生大量虚假退补任务。</li>\n<li>&quot;范围扩大&quot;类公告金额最大，因为它同时改变覆盖面与起始时间；反规避自<strong>发起日</strong>起即适用被覆盖税率。</li>\n<li>调度需防漏报与重报：定时拉取 + 在册案件覆盖率对账 + <code>(notice_id)</code> 去重 + <code>(entry_id, version_id)</code> 幂等约束。</li>\n<li>差异报告应阈值化并路由到采购、定价、合规三条下游，形成闭环而非报表。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"救济税公告变更监控与重算","id":"救济税公告变更监控与重算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"公告源的工程化采集","id":"公告源的工程化采集"},{"level":3,"text":"公告记录的字段设计","id":"公告记录的字段设计"},{"level":3,"text":"采集的两种模式","id":"采集的两种模式"},{"level":2,"text":"从公告到税率版本的重算管线","id":"从公告到税率版本的重算管线"},{"level":3,"text":"六步重算管线","id":"六步重算管线"},{"level":2,"text":"差异报告与影响面评估","id":"差异报告与影响面评估"},{"level":3,"text":"差异类型与财务动作","id":"差异类型与财务动作"},{"level":2,"text":"监控任务的调度与去重","id":"监控任务的调度与去重"},{"level":3,"text":"调度频率与幂等约束","id":"调度频率与幂等约束"},{"level":2,"text":"监控与采购决策的闭环","id":"监控与采购决策的闭环"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值化路由到三条下游","id":"阈值化路由到三条下游"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"供应商与转口采购替代的成本测算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/trade-remedy-add-cvd-quota-duty/remedy-compliance-procurement/supplier-sourcing-substitution"},"next":null}